    {
      "id": "text-22",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 542,
      "y": 148.75,
      "width": 446,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a033",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1929649829,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1221896296,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793886951364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "S2 A股开市 · 境外休市\n（耶稣受难日港股休市／美国独立日）\n指数点位沿用最近境外披露日，\n汇率照常取 t 日 → 该要素日收益\n退化为纯汇率变动 H(t)/H(t−1)−1（非零！）",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect-10",
      "originalText": "S2 A股开市 · 境外休市\n（耶稣受难日港股休市／美国独立日）\n指数点位沿用最近境外披露日，\n汇率照常取 t 日 → 该要素日收益\n退化为纯汇率变动 H(t)/H(t−1)−1（非零！）",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
