    {
      "id": "text-28",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 542,
      "y": 363.75,
      "width": 446,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a039",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 273658091,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2116421344,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793886951364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "S5 = S4 ＋ S2 叠加\n季末非交易日且各要素披露日不同步\n各要素各取自己的最近披露日\n（A股 12-29／美股 12-29／港股半日市 12-31）\n互不传染，同一行内跳空幅度可差异巨大",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect-13",
      "originalText": "S5 = S4 ＋ S2 叠加\n季末非交易日且各要素披露日不同步\n各要素各取自己的最近披露日\n（A股 12-29／美股 12-29／港股半日市 12-31）\n互不传染，同一行内跳空幅度可差异巨大",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
