    {
      "id": "text-30",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1042,
      "y": 363.75,
      "width": 446,
      "height": 87.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a041",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1824650831,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 524325979,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793886951364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "S6 跨时区 · 美股时点\n美股 t 日收盘 = 北京时间 t+1 凌晨\n已定夺：T+1 出具——\n等美股 T 日收盘后计算，取 T 日收盘（不滞后），\n与 QDII 净值 T+1 披露节奏一致",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "rect-14",
      "originalText": "S6 跨时区 · 美股时点\n美股 t 日收盘 = 北京时间 t+1 凌晨\n已定夺：T+1 出具——\n等美股 T 日收盘后计算，取 T 日收盘（不滞后），\n与 QDII 净值 T+1 披露节奏一致",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
